# Competitive research image corpora and the raw harvest.
#
# ~290 MB of third-party material: watermarked capture frames from
# screensdesign.com and App Store marketing screenshots. Deliberately not
# committed — it would sit in every clone forever, it is somebody else's
# imagery, and it is reproducible from the scripts beside it
# (research/harvest_flows.py, research/fetch_screens.py). The conclusions drawn
# from it are committed: see research/onboarding-competitive/patterns.md,
# flow-statistics.md, the per-app notes.md, and README.md for provenance.
research/onboarding-competitive/_data/
research/onboarding-competitive/flows-full/*/*.webp
research/onboarding-competitive/flows-opening/*/*.webp
research/onboarding-competitive/habit-loop/
research/onboarding-competitive/quiz-archetype/
research/onboarding-competitive/paywall-and-post-purchase/
